WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.772
For most of history, when
the body failed,

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:09.050
someone blamed a ghost.
Smoke. A drum. A spell.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.102
Two thousand years ago,
one text refused the spell,

00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:17.500
and reached for the pulse
at the wrist instead.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.285
Instead, it read the body
as a working system.

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:26.297
Storehouses that hold and
never drain.

00:00:26.297 --> 00:00:28.150
Rivers that carry, and
empty again.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.308
Follow a single meal, from
stomach to gut.

00:00:34.308 --> 00:00:36.857
Then find one window, at
the wrist,

00:00:36.857 --> 00:00:38.750
that reports on all of it.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.230
Bound to ghosts, and you
cannot be taught.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.726
Refuse to be treated, and
you cannot be healed.

00:00:46.726 --> 00:00:48.000
That was the revolution.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.533
Not demons. Evidence.

00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:56.331
The Emperor's Inner
Canon. Chapter Eight:

00:00:56.331 --> 00:00:57.900
Storehouses and Ghosts.
